        "created_at": "2019-07-31T09:06:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm just wondering what the point of the Surprise Shift ability is (p. 96). It seems like it's just Change Forms but worse in every way. Every Form-Changer gets Change Forms automatically, then picks between Form Recovery and Surprise Shift; why would anyone ever take the latter? It's just Change Forms but only attack instead of any basic action <em>and</em> you lose Health after using it. Is the ability miswritten or is there some synergy here that I'm somehow missing? Thanks for any input.</p>",
