        "created_at": "2019-07-31T16:18:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>From discussions elsewhere it&nbsp;would appear Surprise Shift is available to use regardless of what Form you’re in. &nbsp;However, Change Form is only available when in your Base Form. &nbsp;It still should be clarified further otherwise Surprise Shift does seem outright worse. &nbsp;</p>",
